:"remote: \nremote: Create a pull request for 'release-0.39.2' on GitHub by visiting:        \nremote:      https://github.com/cv/pit/pull/new/release-0.39.2        \nremote: \nTo https://github.com/cv/pit\n * [new branch]      release-0.39.2 -> release-0.39.2\nbranch 'release-0.39.2' set up to track 'origin/release-0.39.2'.\n","code":0},{"id":14,"traceSequence":17,"command":"gh \"pr\" \"list\" \"--state\" \"open\" \"--limit\" \"1\" \"--head\" \"release-0.39.2\" \"--json\" \"number,url\"","status":"done","output":"[]\n","code":0},{"id":15,"traceSequence":18,"command":"gh \"pr\" \"create\" \"--title\" \"Update to Pi 1.6.0 and release 0.39.2\" \"--body\" \"Refs #417\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n\\n- Pi packages (`pi-coding-agent`, `pi-codemode`, `pi-durable`, `pi-ai`, `pi-tui`, `chord`) 1.5.2 → 1.6.0; peers now `1.6.0` / `^1.6.0`.\\n- oxfmt 0.78.0 → 0.80.0, oxlint 1.93.0 → 1.95.0, Vitest and `@vitest/coverage-v8` → 5.1.1.\\n- Not updated: TypeScript stays on 6.x. TypeScript 7.0 is the native port and has no `typescript` compiler JS API, which Pit uses at runtime. typebox stays at 1.3.27, the version Pi 1.6.0 pins.\\n\\n## Using what Pi 1.6.0 changed\\n\\n- **Stale image note (pi#12131):** Pi's `read` no longer stores \\\"current model does not support images\\\" in the result text, where it stayed after switching to a vision model. Pit's Pi-side `viewImage` gets this from Pi's read. The pi-durable entry built its own note, and now drops it too. The `omitted` flag still drives the TUI notice `image omitted for text-only model`.\\n- **`pi.exec` signal exit codes (pi#12088):** commands killed by a signal now report 128 + the signal number instead of 0, so the non-streaming `shell` path with `raise: true` throws named timeout or cancellation errors. The runner comment now says so.\\n- **Readonly `render()` (pi#9549):** Pit's renderers don't change render output in place. Only the test helper types needed widening.\\n\\n## Release\\n\\nA second commit bumps the version to 0.39.2.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- [x] `delivery.validate({ coverage: true, packageCheck: true })`: check, tests, coverage, and package check all pass\\n- [ ] PR CI green\" \"--base\" \"main\" \"--head\" \"release-0.39.2\"","status":"done","output":"https://github.com/cv/pit/pull/418\n","code":0}],"traces":[{"id":1,"sequence":1,"namespace":"__pit","method":"savedFunctionRun","arguments":[{"type":"string","size":25}],"startedAt":1795491337568,"status":"succeeded","function":{"invocationId":1,"name":"delivery.listChangedFiles","scope":"project","depth":1},"durationMs":0},{"id":2,"sequence":2,"namespace":"shell","method":"execFile","arguments":[{"type":"string","size":3},{"type":"array","size":4},{"type":"object","size":3}],"startedAt":1795491337569,"status":"succeeded","function":{"invocationId":2,"parentInvocationId":1,"name":"git.status","scope":"global","depth":2},"durationMs":10},{"id":3,"sequence":3,"namespace":"__pit","method":"savedFunctionRun","arguments":[{"type":"string","size":24}],"startedAt":1795491337579,"status":"succeeded","function":{"invocationId":3,"name":"delivery.openPullRequest","scope":"project","depth":1},"durationMs":0},{"id":4,"sequence":4,"namespace":"shell","method":"execFile","arguments":[{"type":"string","size":3},{"type":"array","size":3},{"type":"object","size":1}],"startedAt":1795491337580,"status":"succeeded","function":{"invocationId":4,"parentInvocationId":3,"name":"git.revParse","scope":"global","depth":2},"durationMs":6},{"id":5,"sequence":5,"namespace":"shell","method":"execFile","arguments":[{"type":"string","size":3},{"type":"array","size":3},{"type":"object","size":1}],"startedAt":1795491337587,"status":"succeeded","function":{"invocationId":5,"parentInvocationId":3,"name":"git.switchBranch","scope":"global","depth":2},"durationMs":7},{"id":6,"sequence":6,"namespace":"__pit","method":"savedFunctionRun","arguments":[{"type":"string","size":15}],"startedAt":1795491337595,"status":"succeeded","function":{"invocationId":6,"parentInvocati